WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.263
The old tree wasn't good for Bird.

2
00:00:11.264 --> 00:00:15.742
The maple tree wasn't good for Kip.

3
00:00:15.743 --> 00:00:19.605
"This is terrible," said Bird.

4
00:00:19.606 --> 00:00:22.598
"Where are we going to live?"

5
00:00:22.599 --> 00:00:29.319
Kip thought for a moment.

6
00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:33.348
"I know!" he said.

7
00:00:33.349 --> 00:00:35.990
"I can live in this old tree.

8
00:00:35.991 --> 00:00:38.935
You can live in the maple tree."

9
00:00:38.936 --> 00:00:41.339
Bird's eyes lit up.

10
00:00:41.340 --> 00:00:50.252
"We'll each have our own tree!" she said.

11
00:00:50.253 --> 00:00:56.316
Kip cleaned a hole in the old tree.

12
00:00:56.317 --> 00:01:02.841
Bird built a nest in the maple tree.

13
00:01:02.842 --> 00:01:05.443
Bird looked over at Kip.

14
00:01:05.444 --> 00:01:11.565
"How does my new nest look?" she called.

15
00:01:11.566 --> 00:01:15.188
"What did you say?" called Kip.

16
00:01:15.189 --> 00:01:18.286
"What?" called Bird.

17
00:01:18.287 --> 00:01:22.007
"I can't hear you!" called Kip.

18
00:01:22.008 --> 00:01:25.372
"What?" called Bird.

19
00:01:25.373 --> 00:01:36.110
Kip sighed and went over to Bird.

20
00:01:36.111 --> 00:01:40.242
"This was a bad idea, Bird," said Kip.

21
00:01:40.243 --> 00:01:43.145
"Let's fix our old tree."

22
00:01:43.146 --> 00:01:58.353
Bird smiled. "Good idea, Kip."

